        "original_id": "3b704c5c-0691-5a88-9bc9-6c7610bc1f2b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Annie Potts, Laura Summer, Kath Soucie\n- Films: Toy Story, Toy Story 2, Tarzan\n- Characters: Bo Peep, Janine Melnitz\n- Companies: Pixar Animation Studios, Walt Disney Pictures, Walt Disney Feature Animation\n- Television Series: The Real Ghostbusters\n\nFacts:\n- Toy Story is a 1995 American computer-animated buddy comedy adventure film produced by Pixar Animation Studios for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- In 1995, Annie Potts voiced Bo Peep in the animated film Toy Story.\n- Tarzan is a 1999 American animated drama adventure film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- In 1999, Annie Potts voiced Bo Peep in the animated film Toy Story 2.\n- Annie Potts played Janine Melnitz in both Ghostbusters movies.\n- In The Real Ghostbusters, Laura Summer initially voiced Janine Melnitz, and Kath Soucie later voiced Janine Melnitz on the series.",
